exports[`the built-in store's settings page is unchanged > a custom stored connection 1`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthLg css-5c1adp-MuiContainer-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-8f57v9"><div class="MuiStack-root css-sw1t3l-MuiStack-root"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 css-13h84jw-MuiTypography-root">Telemetry</h1><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary css-1w86s7s-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiButton-root" tabindex="0" href="/admin/settings/telemetry/dashboard" data-discover="true"><span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-startIcon css-1lxyhll-MuiButton-startIcon"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-1umw9bq-MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="MonitorHeartOutlinedIcon"><path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v3h2V6h16v3h2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2m0 14H4v-3H2v3c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-3h-2z"></path><path d="M14.89 7.55c-.34-.68-1.45-.68-1.79 0L10 13.76l-1.11-2.21A.988.988 0 0 0 8 11H2v2h5.38l1.72 3.45c.18.34.52.55.9.55s.72-.21.89-.55L14 10.24l1.11 2.21c.17.34.51.55.89.55h6v-2h-5.38z"></path></svg></span>Open dashboard</a></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-9ebprp-MuiTypography-root">Turn telemetry collection on, choose how long it is kept, set query limits and configure the AI assistant.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-1tty75b-MuiTypography-root">Last updated by admin@example.com on 9/1/2026, 10:00:00 AM</p><section class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-mo54xu-MuiPaper-root" aria-label="Telemetry services" id="telemetry-services" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Telemetry services</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-956xpl-MuiTypography-root">The containers that store and collect telemetry for this application.</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-1a6n7l1" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-testid="telemetry-services-live"></div><ul class="MuiStack-root css-kffel9-MuiStack-root"><li class="MuiBox-root css-1jxzuzz"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-11s8ey5-MuiTypography-root">GreptimeDB (telemetry store)</p><div class="MuiChip-root MuiChip-filled MuiChip-sizeSmall MuiChip-colorSuccess css-106f2r9-MuiChip-root"><span class="MuiChip-label css-eccknh-MuiChip-label">Running · healthy</span></div></li><li class="MuiBox-root css-1jxzuzz"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-11s8ey5-MuiTypography-root">OpenTelemetry collector</p><div class="MuiChip-root MuiChip-filled MuiChip-sizeSmall MuiChip-colorSuccess css-106f2r9-MuiChip-root"><span class="MuiChip-label css-eccknh-MuiChip-label">Running</span></div></li></ul><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-outlined MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary css-8df3cg-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiButton-root" tabindex="0" type="button">Redeploy</button></section><section class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-mo54xu-MuiPaper-root" aria-label="Connection" id="telemetry-connection" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><div class="MuiStack-root css-nz951t-MuiStack-root"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 css-1miy0lu-MuiTypography-root">Connection</h2><div data-testid="telemetry-connection-source" class="MuiChip-root MuiChip-filled MuiChip-sizeSmall MuiChip-colorSuccess css-1dlg8cb-MuiChip-root"><span class="MuiChip-label css-eccknh-MuiChip-label">Saved in admin settings</span></div></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-956xpl-MuiTypography-root" data-testid="telemetry-connection-description">How the API reaches GreptimeDB to read telemetry and apply retention. GreptimeDB is deployed with this application, and the Automatic host finds it — leave the host blank. Enter a host only to use an external GreptimeDB. The collector's writer login is managed by the deployment.</p><form class="MuiBox-root css-0" novalidate=""><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-2 css-zjhuaj-MuiGrid-root"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth MuiTextField-root css-cmpglg-MuiFormControl-root-MuiTextField-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-sizeSmall MuiInputLabel-outlined MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary MuiFormLabel-filled MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-sizeSmall MuiInputLabel-outlined css-hvjq6j-MuiFormLabel-root-MuiInputLabel-root" data-shrink="true" for="_r_v_" id="_r_v_-label">Host</label><div class="MuiInputBase-root MuiOutlinedInput-root MuiInputBase-colorPrimary MuiInputBase-fullWidth MuiInputBase-formControl MuiInputBase-sizeSmall css-1blp12k-MuiInputBase-root-MuiOutlinedInput-root"><input aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="_r_v_-helper-text" id="_r_v_" placeholder="Automatic: greptimedb" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" class="MuiInputBase-input MuiOutlinedInput-input css-1pzfmz2-MuiInputBase-input-MuiOutlinedInput-input" type="text" value="greptime.internal"><fieldset aria-hidden="true" class="MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline css-18p5xg2-MuiNotchedOutlined-root-MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline"><legend class="css-ex8a5f-MuiNotchedOutlined-root"><span>Host</span></legend></fieldset></div><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root MuiFormHelperText-sizeSmall MuiFormHelperText-contained MuiFormHelperText-filled css-2s8ubb-MuiFormHelperText-root" id="_r_v_-helper-text