d><dt>Database</dt><dd>telemetry</dd><dt>Retention in force</dt><dd>30 days (30days)</dd></dl><div class="MuiBox-root css-16qjq0e"><table class="MuiTable-root css-1xwxv7r-MuiTable-root" aria-label="Telemetry tables"><thead class="MuiTableHead-root css-1a7iywq-MuiTableHead-root"><tr class="MuiTableRow-root MuiTableRow-head css-1xtozoh-MuiTableRow-root"><th class="MuiTableCell-root MuiTableCell-head MuiTableCell-sizeSmall css-g6bqb5-MuiTableCell-root" scope="col">Table</th><th class="MuiTableCell-root MuiTableCell-head MuiTableCell-alignRight MuiTableCell-sizeSmall css-1ais0ar-MuiTableCell-root" scope="col">Rows</th></tr></thead><tbody class="MuiTableBody-root css-gmh7jj-MuiTableBody-root"><tr class="MuiTableRow-root css-1xtozoh-MuiTableRow-root"><td class="MuiTableCell-root MuiTableCell-body MuiTableCell-sizeSmall css-1bp1vf0-MuiTableCell-root">opentelemetry_traces</td><td class="MuiTableCell-root MuiTableCell-body MuiTableCell-alignRight MuiTableCell-sizeSmall css-17j8okc-MuiTableCell-root">12,345</td></tr><tr class="MuiTableRow-root css-1xtozoh-MuiTableRow-root"><td class="MuiTableCell-root MuiTableCell-body MuiTableCell-sizeSmall css-1bp1vf0-MuiTableCell-root">opentelemetry_logs</td><td class="MuiTableCell-root MuiTableCell-body MuiTableCell-alignRight MuiTableCell-sizeSmall css-17j8okc-MuiTableCell-root">678</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1yuhvjn"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-sizeSmall MuiButton-colorPrimary css-1ccsd5i-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiButton-root" tabindex="0" type="button">Refresh status</button></div></section><form class="MuiBox-root css-0" novalidate=""><section class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-mo54xu-MuiPaper-root" aria-label="Collection" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Collection</h2><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root MuiSwitch-sizeMedium css-rehya9-MuiSwitch-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiSwitch-switchBase MuiSwitch-colorPrimary Mui-checked Mui-checked css-aqlqb4-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiSwitch-switchBase"><input role="switch" aria-label="Collect telemetry" class="PrivateSwitchBase-input MuiSwitch-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="MuiSwitch-thumb css-1mw77bv-MuiSwitch-thumb"></span></span><span class="MuiSwitch-track css-pm6g3f-MuiSwitch-track"></span></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiFormControlLabel-label css-rizt0-MuiTypography-root">Collect telemetry</span></label><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Export of traces, logs and metrics starts or stops within seconds on every instance — no restart. Nothing is collected while no telemetry store is configured.</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-b5i6a0"><div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth MuiTextField-root css-cmpglg-MuiFormControl-root-MuiTextField-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-sizeSmall MuiInputLabel-outlined MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-sizeSmall MuiInputLabel-outlined css-1kfabtt-MuiFormLabel-root-MuiInputLabel-root" data-shrink="false" for="_r_m_" id="_r_m_-label">Instance identifier</label><div class="MuiInputBase-root MuiOutlinedInput-root MuiInputBase-colorPrimary MuiInputBase-fullWidth MuiInputBase-formControl MuiInputBase-sizeSmall css-1blp12k-MuiInputBase-root-MuiOutlinedInput-root"><input aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="_r_m_-helper-text" id="_r_m_" placeholder="my-app" autocapitalize="none" autocorrect="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="63" class="MuiInputBase-input MuiOutlinedInput-input css-1pzfmz2-MuiInputBase-input-MuiOutlinedInput-input" type="text" value=""><fieldset aria-hidden="true" class="MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline css-18p5xg2-MuiNotchedOutlined-root-MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline"><legend class="css-1n64csd-MuiNotchedOutlined-root"><span>Instance identifier</span></legend></fieldset></div><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root MuiFormHelperText-sizeSmall MuiFormHelperText-contained css-2s8ubb-MuiFormHelperText-root" id="_r_m_-helper-text">Labels every trace, log and metric as <code>app.instance.id</code> so dashboards can filter and aggregate across deployments that share a telemetry store. Leave blank to use the default, <code>my-app</code>. Currently in use: <code data-testid="telemetry-instance-id-effective">my-app</code>.</p></div></div></section><section class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-mo54xu-MuiPaper-root" aria-label="Retention" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Retention</h2><div role="group" class="MuiToggleButtonGroup-root MuiToggleButtonGroup-horizontal css-1fe81xt-MuiToggleButtonGroup-root" aria-label="Retention period"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButton-root MuiToggleButton-sizeSmall MuiToggleButton-standard MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButtonGroup-firstButton css-qofxz1-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiToggleButton-root" tabindex="0" type="button" value="7" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="7 days">7 days</button><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButton-root Mui-selected MuiToggleButton-sizeSmall MuiToggleButton-standard MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButtonGroup-middleButton css-qofxz1-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiToggleButton-root" tabindex="-1" type="button" value="30" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="30 days">30 days</button><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButton-root MuiToggleButton-sizeSmall MuiToggleButton-standard MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButtonGroup-middleButton css-qofxz1-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiToggleButton-root" tabindex="-1" type="button" value="90" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="90 days">90 days</button><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButton-root MuiToggleButton-sizeSmall MuiToggleButton-standard MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButtonGroup-middleButton css-qofxz1-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiToggleButton-root" tabindex="-1" type="button" value="180" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="180 days">180 days</button><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButton-root MuiToggleButton-sizeSmall MuiToggleButton-standard MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButtonGroup-middleButton css-qofxz1-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiToggleButton-root" tabindex="-1" type="button" value="365" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="365 days">365 days</button><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButton-root MuiToggleButton-sizeSmall MuiToggleButton-standard MuiToggleButtonGroup-grouped MuiToggleButtonGroup-lastButton css-qofxz1-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiToggleButton-root" tabindex="-1" type="button" value="custom" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Custom">Custom</button></div><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root css-r9aic6-MuiFormHelperText-root">Retention is applied to the telemetry store by a background job after each save (and re-asserted nightly), so older data is dropped shortly after, not instantly.</p></section><section class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-mo54xu-MuiPaper-root" aria-label="Query limits" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rg